@title Project files: old .novo opens, Save As writes .kopercad
@area Files
# The golden v0.1 file is an old .novo project. It must open; Save As is answered with a .kopercad
# path and must write it. The native Open/Save dialogs are answered by the harness (their filter
# and suggested name go to the dialog log, see docs/testing/qa-suite.md).
answer_dialog crates/novo-tests/tests/golden/v0.1-motor-starter.novo
key ctrl+o
wait 20
expect_dialog "filter KoperCAD project (.kopercad .novo) -> answered"
expect_scene K1
expect "Older file format"
shot old-novo-opened
check_layout
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/starter.kopercad
key ctrl+shift+s
wait 20
expect_dialog "filter KoperCAD project (.kopercad) -> answered"
expect_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/starter.kopercad" 4096
shot saved-as-kopercad
check_layout
